        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 190,
          "text": {
            "en_us": "A unique Halloween Reaper spawns at the map's fixed coordinate: right-click to open a shop trading items for pumpkins and coins, and deliver a Soul Contract near the Reaper to register the server-wide unique revival. Sneak with empty hands and right-click a small door to knock; each player has an independent cooldown: 60% chance for 1–2 pumpkins, 30% to spawn an undead, 10% for a candy bag; there is also a 20% chance a temporary candy Reaper appears. In Halloween rounds, the backpack shop of players who sell knives can additionally buy an 8-durability Blood Saw for 200 coins. Every 3 real tasks completed grants a 20% chance to earn a Soul Contract; after delivery, dying revives you as an unattackable Soul-Bound Wraith who wins with the faction of the nearest living player at revival. Each real task completed by a living player grants 1–2 Halloween pumpkins (candy and candy bags each have a separate 10% chance); pumpkin rewards are boosted by 30%, then halved again for the civilian faction. The Fright Gun, Bone Sword and Blood Saw are usable; gunshots, door knocks or kills near the Reaper spawn orange-gold event undead. The Pumpkin Spirit only spawns on Halloween maps and wins alone by collecting enough pumpkins.",
            "zh_cn": "地图固定坐标生成唯一的万圣残月：右键打开商店用南瓜与金币兑换道具，靠近残月可交付魂契并登记复活资格。",
            "zh_tw": "地圖固定座標生成唯一的萬聖殘月：右鍵打開商店用南瓜與金幣兌換道具，靠近殘月可交付魂契並登記復活資格。"
          },
          "point": [
            3.0,
            1.8,
            4.0
          ],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 200
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 164,
          "text": {
            "en_us": "潜行并空手右键小门可敲门，每名玩家拥有独立冷却：60%概率获得1–2个南瓜、30%生成亡灵、10%获得糖果袋；另有20%概率出现发糖残月。",
            "zh_cn": "潜行并空手右键小门可敲门，每名玩家拥有独立冷却：60%概率获得1–2个南瓜、30%生成亡灵、10%获得糖果袋；另有20%概率出现发糖残月。",
            "zh_tw": "潛行並空手右鍵小門可敲門，每名玩家擁有獨立冷卻：60%概率獲得1–2個南瓜、30%生成亡靈、10%獲得糖果袋；另有20%概率出現發糖殘月。"
          },
          "point": [
            3.0,
